6. **Jumanji** (1995) - This beloved children's adventure film follows four teenagers who find themselves sucked into a magical board game. With plenty of laughs and excitement, this movie has become a modern classic. If you loved Jumanji, why not try other fun family flicks like **Zootopia** (2016) or **Moana** (2016)?

